WEBVTT

00:01:58.805 --> 00:02:01.472
he was working
on a PowerPoint presentation.

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:03.596
He was working in a big bank,

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:07.009
and this was in preparation
for a merger and acquisition.

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:09.921
And he was working very hard
on this presentation --

00:02:09.945 --> 00:02:11.930
graphs, tables, information.

00:02:11.954 --> 00:02:14.901
He stayed late at night every day.

00:02:15.464 --> 00:02:17.654
And the day before it was due,

00:02:17.678 --> 00:02:20.988
he sent his PowerPoint
presentation to his boss,

00:02:21.012 --> 00:02:23.618
and his boss wrote him back and said,

00:02:23.642 --> 00:02:27.134
"Nice presentation,
but the merger is canceled."

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:30.157
And the guy was deeply depressed.